The '''1992 United States Senate election in Wisconsin''' was held on November 3, 1992. Incumbent [[Republican Party (United States)|Republican]] U.S. Senator [[Bob Kasten]] ran for re-election to a third term but was defeated by [[Democratic Party (United States)|Democrat]] [[Russ Feingold]].

