==General election==
===Results===
While [[Bill Clinton]], [[George H. W. Bush]], and [[Ross Perot]] split the Wisconsin presidential vote 41% to 37% to 21%, Feingold beat Kasten by a margin of 53% to 46%.<ref name="wagner-blog" />

